# Quistis Trepe: "When Quistis Trepe enters, you may cast target instant or sorcery card from a graveyard, and mana of any type can be spent to cast that spell. If that spell
# would be put into a graveyard, exile it instead." Bot1 kills its own Memnite with a Lightning Bolt paid by Mox Ruby, so its graveyard holds a creature card and an
# instant: only the Bolt is a legal target, so none is asked for. Quistis is paid with Black Lotus; the Bolt is cast as the trigger resolves, its {R} paid with the black mana
# of a Mox Jet, and it deals 3 to Bot2. The Bolt is then in exile, not the graveyard, with the Memnite still there.

